# Path Document Template

<!--
  === HOW TO USE ===
  For each important directory in your project:
  1. Copy the AI.md template below → save as `AI.md` in that directory
  2. Copy the ai.json template below → save as `ai.json` in that directory
  3. Fill in all {{PLACEHOLDER}} values with directory-specific content
  4. Keep both files in sync — fitness gate will check this

  Priority chain: nearest ai.json > nearest AI.md > parent AI.md > root AI.md > AGENTS.md
  Subdirectory docs may REFINE parent rules but must not VIOLATE them.
-->

